{"author": "tfm2mods", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.6.0"}], "description": "Read-only match-flow capture. Samples every on-screen match (replay / spectate / your matches / comp-test) every 30 ticks and writes a trace file for offline analysis (gold curve, kill timeline, objectives, snowball). Stable mod API - no game-version-specific addresses.", "last_updated": "2026-09-25", "mod_id": "tfm2_flow_capture", "name": "TFM2 Flow Capture", "version": "0.8.0"}